Z||000009||DecadenceR||07-29-2001||12:44 PM||||I don't believe in the whole "political corect" thing either. Our country got by for hundreds of years without this PC bull, and I'm sure we'll do fine a lot more without it.  It's just something else for someone else to yell about. We have out ethnic-american groups, out alternative livestyle groups, animal rights groups, mother earth groups, and the people who still think OJ is innocent. I don't try to please everyone all the time. It'll never happen. I just say what's on my mind. Hopefully I'll offend the smaller amount of people with it, but ya never know.||||reg||1
Z||000010||Songman||07-29-2001||01:44 PM||||The reason for the influx of female artists into country music has nothing to do with their talent, or in my opinion, nothing to do with politics either of course it could be partly.<P>The reason for all the girls in country music is the same for all of the Wrangler-wearing George Strait wannabes, the Garth clones, the girl trios, the quartets, the teenage artists... and not just in country music either. What about all of the 'boy bands' in pop music?<P>It all comes down to money and lack of imagination. When someone hits on an idea that works then everybody has to copy it until we are so sick of it that we turn to something else.<P>It is a whole different topic that is more discussed on my TradinPost forum than here, that the sad fact is that there is no country music on the country charts anymore. It is pop music done by people who claim to be country because they were cashing in on the popularity of country music for the last ten years. A true country artist has a hard time getting played on radio these days. And it has nothing to do with the desire of the fans. Everywhere you read fan letters they want real country...<P>A lot can be said about any country or any group by the music they listen to. As the morality declined in our country, the morality in our music followed.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
