Z||000013||Stage-2GT||07-29-2001||10:27 PM||||  Why, Hello there Gaylen, you want to but heads do you? well you tell me the last time you were able to get audience with your state senator or congressman? When was the last time you complained about the  decisions coming from capitol hill? <BR>  Let me tell you a little story that haapened to me. I live in southern Nevada.A friend of mine used to be a member of this forum untill recently. I was actually the one that turned him onto this place. Anyway, that doesn't matter. However the place does. I once, about a year or so ago, wanted to speak with our state senator Harry Reid. i was told that senator Reid was to busy with scheduled political events and meeting to grant my wish. I had some real concerns about the direction of developement in the southern nevada area and convenient rezonings that were happening on behalf of the afluent. I felt that my concerns and questions fit perfectly into the political agenda. Yet I was turned away, not once, but three times. You ddon't see my point yet do you Gaylen? <BR>  Well, you have see the other side of the story to see it. Now one of the worst violator of this sham was also one of the wealthiest members of the community and the nation for that matter. How do you suppose it is that he was granted a meeting with senator Reid durring this time of great political maylay? Simple, MONEY!. That's what your politicians are all about. <BR>  How is it that political representatives are some of the lowest payed management personel on the planet, yet live like kings. It's because they are there for their own agenda, not yours and not mine. They are there to manipulate and swindle the public for all they can and when they get caught (read the news everyday, someone is always getting caught) they rewrite the definition of there crime to suit their needs. Remember that A-Hole Clinton who rewrote the definition of sexual contact? And the American people bought it?? I don't think so. The people in charge of his tribunal allowed him to get away with it. Now if it were you in a similar situation, how do you think you would fair?? Man you would be out on your arse!! <BR>  I hate politicians, plain and simple. They are there to represent the voice of their constituency and forgoe personal agendas? Yeah right, just like you are innocent untill proven guilty. We complain about people getting laid of and the loss of jobs in America, well what do you suppose happened? Ever heard of NAFTA??? Hell your precious politicians sent your jobs outside the boarders. What about the Farmers and ranchers. Hell you buddies are getting most of our grains and meats from foreign sources. how do you like your insurance rates??? Bet you didn't know that most insurance companies are foreign controlled now did ya? Why, because you political pals allow it. Why do they allow these things to happen???? MONEY IN THEIR POCKETS!!!!!!<P>Eat that Gaylen!<P><BR>S2GT <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><BR>Sorry I did not spell check first! <P>------------------<BR>"If Hate Was Money, I Would Own The World"||||reg||1
