Z||000034||AusFiero||08-01-2001||07:01 AM||||Ok I know the world will never change as someone is always badly done by. But here is my little stories.<P>I went for a job once with my local council in IT. It was a good job too. I got knocked backed even before the interview stage. Why I asked them, I have the required "skills". Seemed they had an employment criteria to work in that particular position.<P>It was cross section based and they would only take on 60% women 30% Aboriginal, 20% Asian 20% disabled. I said where does the white Australian male fit in there. He doesn't was the reply. Seems if I was a disabled aboriginal women with an asiam passport I woulda been in like Flyn. Similar thing happened with a recent Job at the ABC. Advertised as an "equal opportunity " position, But you had to be Aboriginal to apply, as is the case with many of our good government jobs.<P>Scenario 2: Wollongong where I live had a mens club. For 120 years it was open and men used to go there to get away from the women in a real mans cedar and leather respectable gentlemans club type enviroment. Well the feminists jumped up and down and took the club to court and had the place closed down claiming it was sexist.<BR>The same feminists then called it a victory for womens rights when a womens only gymnasium was started not 2 blocks away by one of them and men were sexist pigs to call it wrong. <P>What happened with equal rights for women and other races was it got reversed to the point that the average white male is now the discriminated against. So many important issues in the world and politicians make rules about this sorta stuff. <P>Thank goodness I lock myself in my own little world and work for myself. Oh no, I just looked at my fish wrong. They are having a meeting over by the rock now.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
Z||000035||Songman||08-01-2001||09:07 AM||||I know I'll get accused of being a bad ole American, but I hadn't even thought of this kind of reversal being a problem in other countries... especially Australia.<P>When I was in the corporate world years ago, I was friends with the guy who was the head of HR. We had that same talk many times. As a single white male under 30, I didn't have a chance!<P>If I had the nerve for it I'd go enter the Miss Black USA pageant and raise hell when they tried to stop me! Maybe we can talk Galen in to it! heheh<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000036||elfiero||08-01-2001||09:34 AM||||I work for a huge multi-national corp.Here<BR>we have a 1.womans network 2.black network<BR>3.asian network.What do ya think would<BR>happen to me if I started a white middleaged<BR>males network?-I would be out the door sooo<BR>fast,my feet would'nt touch the ground!years<BR>ago,I applied for a job with the county I<BR>live in as a heavy equipment mechanic.I took<BR>the skills test,the civil service test,and a<BR>bunch of other tests-it took a couple of days<BR>to do it all.At the end the director called<BR>me into his office and closed the door.....<BR>He said bruce,we are not haviving this conversation but I can't hire you.You are by<BR>far the top score on every test we gave you<BR>but I have been ordered to hire a minorety<BR>to fill this position.I did'nt want you to<BR>waste any more time waiting for this job.I<BR>asked him how far down the list of applicants<BR>he would have to go to hire someone and he<BR>said 8!!<BR>I guess some poeple have more rights than<BR>white guys from the 'burbs.||||reg||8
